# Talion's Messenger: "Whenever you attack with one or more Faeries, draw a card, then discard a card. When you discard a card this
# way, put a +1/+1 counter on target Faerie you control." Talion's Messenger, Faerie Miscreant (both Faeries) and an Ornithopter
# (a Thopter) attack together on turn 3: the two Faeries are one batch (CR 603.2c) so the ability triggers once. Bot1 draws the Forest,
# discards the Island (the hand was Island from the turn's draw step), and then picks the Faerie Miscreant for the counter - it is
# a 2/2 and the Messenger is still a 1/3, the Ornithopter (not a Faerie) was not a legal target (refused).

